            "cue": "different"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Snow is amazing! Ask a grown-up to subscribe to The Curio Kids Club for more wonders, and share this with a friend! And next time someone asks... how are snowflakes made?"
